<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσημ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>announce by signs</i> or <i>signals, give notice,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.20
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>give a sign</i> or <i>signal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				276b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσήματα ἀ.</span>”
				<i>show themselves,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					954b30
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>indicate by signs</i> or <i>symptoms,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.9
				</span></i>
			; =
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηλῶδαι</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				676
			</span></i>; <i>denote, represent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.7.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>indicate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				1.3.8
			</span></i>, al.; <i>declare,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.8.1
			</span></i>,al.:—
				Med.
			, <i>show by signs</i> or <i>proofs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.71
			</span></i>; <i>guess by signs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				6.58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἴς τινα</span>
			<i>allude to</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.27
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.177b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
				</span></i>
			<i>V A</i><i><span class="en">
				6.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>give adverse signs, be unpropitious,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> in 
				Med.
			, <i>seal up as confiscated, sequestrate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				432
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.21
			</span></i>; of persons, <i>proscribe,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.4.13
			</span></i> (also 
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσημανῶ: ἀποδιώξω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>seal up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					4.12.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
